+# Request accountability
+
+- **Pursue an available public-source lead:** completed two indexed queries and one native public catalogue query; inspected the actual three-page May 11 MFR reproduction. Original September 14 letter not recovered. S1/P01–P09 identify the new content and limits.
+- **Underlying records rather than another retelling:** acquired a qualified interview-record reproduction with a specified original-note form/holder and annotation/relay targets. No original note/audio/letter or complete custody accepted. It does not substitute for the missing native inputs.
+- **Preserve sources and conflicting values:** raw text and six viewport captures retained separately; all prior sources unchanged; COMPARISONS.json preserves count, timing, role, information-basis and certainty differences. No preferred value or causal resolution.
+- **Exact source references:** SOURCES.json records URLs/access/fingerprints/entity forms; SOURCE-PINS.json records actual page/paragraph/DOM-line locators and image names. Browser capture hashes are not native PDF/audio hashes. Four current source byte checks cover only stated entities.
+- **Missing inputs as TODOs and all five tracks:** OPEN-TODOS.json carries the new individual-note/letter/MFR/manifest/relay targets; original 18 requirements remain open or partial in the native goal state. Existing technical owners and completed prior tests are not duplicated or relabeled complete.
+- **Both-direction scrutiny:** note-value limitation, same-witness/source dependence, manifest qualification and tentative recollections retained. No conspiracy, concealment, caller-fakery, foreknowledge or independent measurement inferred.
+- **Revision accountability:** this is an additive supplementary report, not a correction of the earlier sources. TEXT-CHANGES.diff records every public note/JSON addition against its immediately preceding absence; previous report and public history remain unchanged. No PDF export/layout generation occurred.
+- **Public eligibility:** selected safe original research/paraphrases and source links only; no raw marked source/full speech, contact/personal/financial/access/signature data, private case/correspondence/strategy or credentials. No reconstructed redacted identities.
+- **Publication and identity:** completion is established only by separate actual AveLyra account/repository/SSH/author/committer and remote-ref/all-file receipts. This prepublication checklist does not claim a push, main merge, acceptance or Overview delivery.
+- **Excluded actions:** no outreach, fees, new FOIA/request/filing, experiment, personal mailbox, deletion, overwrite, private push or history rewrite. Overview handoff remains subject to the separately recorded transmission boundary; no send attempted.
